(7597269, 1226207, 87808, '<td valign="top">I came back to look at this one again, I was not sure what it was about this, that I wanted to see. I think, it was a much tighter crop.  I know it sounds silly, but to see the tighter crop, I held my hands in a circle, almost like a camera lens (and yes, I look stupid doing it, my kids disown me every time) and it the backpack and dog are centered, with a glimpse of the pole and car bumpers. It seemed more impactful to me that way, more of a gritty glimpse. But then again, I could be talking rubbish and just talking about my own take on it and being disrespectful.  I am never sure, if I am.</td>', 'I came back to look at this one again, I was not sure what it was about this, that I wanted to see. I think, it was a much tighter crop.  I know it sounds silly, but to see the tighter crop, I held my hands in a circle, almost like a camera lens (and yes, I look stupid doing it, my kids disown me every time) and it the backpack and dog are centered, with a glimpse of the pole and car bumpers. It seemed more impactful to me that way, more of a gritty glimpse. But then again, I could be talking rubbish and just talking about my own take on it and being disrespectful.  I am never sure, if I am.', '2018-09-21 13:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597270, 1226184, 124815, '<td valign="top">Astonishing. Have I voted or even glimpsed at the challenge, you''d have passed the 8 mark, for what''s worth.<br/>There is often a moment of epiphany in the pockets of light</td>', 'Astonishing. Have I voted or even glimpsed at the challenge, you''d have passed the 8 mark, for what''s worth.There is often a moment of epiphany in the pockets of light', '2018-09-21 13:16:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597279, 1226152, 87808, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8, only 1 of two.(and this came 3rd on the order by my vote), I really smiled at her smile when I saw it and adore her head piece. I live fairly near the Border, so it is quite a large festival here (as are many others) and I have just realized, I have never been to one. Independence Day, Day of the Dead, in fact any kind of parades for anything in Tucson, nothing. And I have no idea why, I can not think of one reason. That is terrible. <br/> <br/>So not only is this a fabulous, happy vibrant photo, you have stirred up a bit of a panicked guilt at all the things I have missed. So well done you, for making me feel that way and making me go out to the next festivities that happen!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-09-21 13:26:36.</i></td>', 'I gave this an 8, only 1 of two.(and this came 3rd on the order by my vote), I really smiled at her smile when I saw it and adore her head piece. I live fairly near the Border, so it is quite a large festival here (as are many others) and I have just realized, I have never been to one. Independence Day, Day of the Dead, in fact any kind of parades for anything in Tucson, nothing. And I have no idea why, I can not think of one reason. That is terrible.  So not only is this a fabulous, happy vibrant photo, you have stirred up a bit of a panicked guilt at all the things I have missed. So well done you, for making me feel that way and making me go out to the next festivities that happen!', '2018-09-21 13:31:36.000000', '2018-09-21 14:26:36.000000', 0),
(7597283, 1226177, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Perfect for this challenge. Can''t figure out what the black dots on his face are. Flies? Scars from buckshot? Handsome creature!</td>', 'Great capture. Perfect for this challenge. Can''t figure out what the black dots on his face are. Flies? Scars from buckshot? Handsome creature!', '2018-09-21 14:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597284, 1226177, 87808, '<td valign="top">This really was a glimpse, brilliant, reminds me of the parks you can drive through in England. Only reason I say that, is I did that with my kiddies all the time when we went back home and your photo reminds me of Suffolk and Norfolk''s parks. I think it is rutting season right now over there? so great capture!</td>', 'This really was a glimpse, brilliant, reminds me of the parks you can drive through in England. Only reason I say that, is I did that with my kiddies all the time when we went back home and your photo reminds me of Suffolk and Norfolk''s parks. I think it is rutting season right now over there? so great capture!', '2018-09-21 14:23:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597285, 1225903, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is so good, I am insanely jealous of people that manage to get a fantastic shot like this of humming birds. This was an 8 from me, one of only 2 and came 2nd place on the order by my vote. Really well done!</td>', 'This is so good, I am insanely jealous of people that manage to get a fantastic shot like this of humming birds. This was an 8 from me, one of only 2 and came 2nd place on the order by my vote. Really well done!', '2018-09-21 14:25:38.000000', NULL, 0),
