(7597300, 1226049, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific image of graphic elegance, simplicity and ,yes, also complexity.  Joyous and whimsical.  The yellow ball in the water that echoes the man''s head is absolutely perfect.  The colors work well together.  I have to smile.<br/>One of two personal favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'Terrific image of graphic elegance, simplicity and ,yes, also complexity.  Joyous and whimsical.  The yellow ball in the water that echoes the man''s head is absolutely perfect.  The colors work well together.  I have to smile.One of two personal favorites for this challenge.', '2018-09-21 15:24:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597301, 1226005, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  But cheerful, also, at least to my eyes.  What a great foreground; now that I''ve seen these figures I can''t imagine any others.  A tight, evocative scene.</td>', 'Perfect title.  But cheerful, also, at least to my eyes.  What a great foreground; now that I''ve seen these figures I can''t imagine any others.  A tight, evocative scene.', '2018-09-21 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597303, 1225869, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of the finest minimalist images I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'One of the finest minimalist images I''ve ever seen.', '2018-09-21 15:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597305, 1226193, 173844, '<td valign="top">Best pure glimpse of them all, the boats on the water emerging from a dream, emerging from sleep, those first seconds.  The fog lingers on up the slope, where sits a ground cap and a flamingo-like pipe.  This is, almost by default, the center of attention, yet my eyes dance back and forth between them and the evanescent boats.  This isn''t dizzying but rather pleasant.  It''s a quirky serenity to drift into.<br/>One of two personal favorites of this challenge.</td>', 'Best pure glimpse of them all, the boats on the water emerging from a dream, emerging from sleep, those first seconds.  The fog lingers on up the slope, where sits a ground cap and a flamingo-like pipe.  This is, almost by default, the center of attention, yet my eyes dance back and forth between them and the evanescent boats.  This isn''t dizzying but rather pleasant.  It''s a quirky serenity to drift into.One of two personal favorites of this challenge.', '2018-09-21 15:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
